Version 8.2.0 - 2026-10-19
--------------------------
* Bump to Tryton 8.2 (requires Python 3.10)
* Remove the group assignments of res.user_admin (administrators have full
  access since Tryton 8.2) and of res.group_admin to the sequence types
* Let administrators pass the module's own group checks
  (User.is_administrator())
* Spell out the negation of the searchers is_mine / overdue (a domain has no
  'NOT')
* Accept the list of values of check_modification on create
